mbbR7hORRFwQ7kNvwG9sjCB&_nc_oc=AdpOO9szz8KPHzPH0onr53-dF8eqKFXTGn7CH9-K4SnBwarkYSyYvV_5mZ0Z8AA1RCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNk3OoJf8bVMGa7P9kRZUPTJC48rRxrEHXwZGSQp3_LyQ&oe=6AD23137"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QsaPoYrb_L8Q7kNvwH3JeW4&_nc_oc=Adrtvo9zxg58g0FoLPx1Wh0usO5cFFxBXSuzfhDE5HQgpwrA9rJsba9_0wk7lyqzGrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXm2c9ipsieNxYGyEN9kCZvQ3FWxpWGe4fL3OMyntKHA&oe=6AD232CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ra7UGBZjRbUQ7kNvwGP9sGw&_nc_oc=AdpzFTmBFpgKGW54WUoPvIb5phEgkCCNp_0OVfSn3vSFX5BpPoimgXFMVvX8LchgFrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMHHgLpph4InVwWKSSRbnsksN6J2PebQNoA94PVYvx08Q&oe=6AD2582F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLeiDWK2xG4Q7kNvwEW7JAL&_nc_oc=AdoUTE3QkAXS3kOX8Q923u5bGv37EheeJG6OfBoy80ppfWGd0o-Lupubs4G0EKp2WPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPMFYkKtPlGVhekBDcLAgqicEL3VkxZeqqAp8oIhyilNQ&oe=6AD24183"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CN1exmsr6nMQ7kNvwGSBQGD&_nc_oc=AdpV0qTko_G53zAcY6iduieGnT3MkZe2FK6jOrs7vISHt93WgQlyv1-we5zFt-pLMqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPXpzwB8b9HfHl7Gu9sxvhBJjvCc3UVP2xOUh3dmzMdfQ&oe=6AD239D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iRbwSYdyMIEQ7kNvwF9DGo6&_nc_oc=AdqsNvz97HMbV8k_nAU3BuyYUlo_qErNfkT2TScEoyzj10NTjsWOfzJ9BR_t7M9jMa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNCjzMWi7O6YV3rEQ4fPnBPOzMvBdKagMjpXirdrOTyMw&oe=6AD24CFC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080